        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get Storage Credentials",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.cloud.wherobots.com/storage/credentials",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Return temporary AWS credentials scoped to the requested S3 path.\n\nResolution order:\n1. Managed storage (org file store bucket)\n2. WherobotsDB releases bucket (if the org has the feature)\n3. User-defined storage integrations (prefix match)\n\n`payload.access_mode` controls whether returned credentials are read-only\nor include write permissions.\n\nReturns empty credentials for public buckets (no role_arn)."
        },
